      "x": 496,
      "y": 443,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "// resolveSubject(): collect every match\nbuiltin destructive + builtin guarded\n+ config rules + session rules\n+ out-of-workspace and write-boundary guards\nany deny → deny; any ask → ask; else allow\nno match: in-tree read → allow\n          defaultMode allowAll → allow, else ask\nbash: per segment, most restrictive wins",
